  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5d8363db-ab29-5685-98ae-eacca53458fb" activityNameId="923b25f9-8079-5c53-97ab-aa2bda5723e5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, aircraft, freight</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, aircraft, freight
Average fuel consumption and emission data caused by an average flight with departure in Switzerland. The allocation between intercontinental (94.6%) and intra European (5.4%) transport performance is made on basis of the yearly transport performance of aircrafts departing from Swiss airports. The emissions are given for three subcategories: low poulated are, startosphere and unspecified.;
UUID: 541e7c7c-2860-3d21-8a64-e68a048584c1
The invetory includes consumption of kerosene and direct emissions to air (gaseous emissions, particulate emissions, emissions of heavy metals)
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: The data is calculated for today"s average aircraft technology
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: national statistics, publications of environmental agencies, information from aviation companies 
Extrapolations: Swiss data is extrapolated to represent European conditions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_541e7c7c-2860-3d21-8a64-e68a048584c1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
